  "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is correct. Let <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> represent the number that <math alttext=\"21\"><mn>21</mn>\n</math> is <math alttext=\"21 percent sign\"><mn>21</mn><mo>%</mo></math> of. It follows that <math alttext=\"StartFraction 21 Over x EndFraction equals StartFraction 21 Over 100 EndFraction\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mfrac>\n\t\t\t<mn>21</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</mfrac>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mfrac>\n\t\t<mn>21</mn>\n\t\t<mn>100</mn>\n\t</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Multiplying each side of this equation by <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> yields <math alttext=\"21 equals StartFraction 21 x Over 100 EndFraction\"><mrow>\n\t<mn>21</mn>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mfrac>\n\t\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t\t<mn>21</mn>\n\t\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>100</mn>\n\t\t</mfrac>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Multiplying each side of this equation by <math alttext=\"100\"><mn>100</mn>\n</math> yields <math alttext=\"2,100 equals 21 x\"><mrow>\n\t<mn>2,100</mn>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mn>21</mn>\n\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Dividing each side of this equation by <math alttext=\"21\"><mn>21</mn>\n</math> yields <math alttext=\"100 equals x\"><mrow>\n\t<mn>100</mn>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Therefore, <math alttext=\"21\"><mn>21</mn>\n</math> is <math alttext=\"21 percent sign\"><mn>21</mn><mo>%</mo></math> of <math alttext=\"100\"><mn>100</mn>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect.&nbsp;<math alttext=\"21 percent sign\"><mn>21</mn><mo>%</mo></math> of <math alttext=\"0\"><mn>0</mn>\n</math> is <math alttext=\"0\"><mn>0</mn>\n</math>, not <math alttext=\"21\"><mn>21</mn>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect.&nbsp;<math alttext=\"21 percent sign\"><mn>21</mn><mo>%</mo></math> of <math alttext=\"1\"><mn>1</mn>\n</math> is <math alttext=\"0.21\"><mn>0.21</mn>\n</math>, not <math alttext=\"21\"><mn>21</mn>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect.&nbsp;<math alttext=\"21 percent sign\"><mn>21</mn><mo>%</mo></math> of <math alttext=\"42\"><mn>42</mn>\n</math> is <math alttext=\"8.82\"><mn>8.82</mn>\n</math>, not <math alttext=\"21\"><mn>21</mn>\n</math>.</p>",
